  m_Name: ArcadeGameFlatline
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 84
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Flatline
  Description: 'Brittle Stars only - a duel through thin panes of prisms. A pane stops your rounds, but
    your cords cut straight through it, so nobody is safe behind one. Throw your ring
    face-on into a pane and it bursts flat along it - get off a pane when a ring comes
    spinning at you. A round on a rival is one point and a cord strike is eight; the ring
    scores nothing. Crystals on the seams give you spare rings. First team to the target
    wins.'
